{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0125d32da961ae508b73466e7bdadf0ac1081629639d9b83fa58779a03735a90",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83060d745dceb8bd21ca5119871c757d15f6c47988840bd56706e79ea43bdfa5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n关于下次的拍摄，能稍微找你商量一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6675d6089c919cb09cc4d8d696a0193186f7cc82b9b1af0f491acfdc10f69909",
      "text": "好的，没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d35065c2c031580c9bd19c6a56209810f6369593f68624db706ad90fa3b0b6",
      "text": "前阵子，我和一起参加拍摄的大家，\n试着练习了扮演幽灵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c58ef8c646c3da939f3d98bce93ea65e8c258b04fe27b6ceb3a3da27e40a01ec",
      "text": "听说在鬼屋里，会突然跳出来吓唬观众\n之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e75c608969da5a35547ccf8f9b8eabc7fe3271e5e33a7e6521bdcbe1f9cd90",
      "text": "可是别人说由我来做的话，\n感觉一点都不可怕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16730bbd4834e16c73e5d2ef881e9bdc7f0035252ecf7a018b92e01a4d7b207a",
      "text": "我也听取了大家的意见，\n正在思考该怎么去表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca501bfd459a8faa879d58ebb73cbd93410268a403fb667028bc24765522a249",
      "text": "怎样才能更像个幽灵呢，\n也能让我听听你的意见吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b90f244ee50196aefcb9afeff97bf5922c8ff5a41e7f19319e8ee6151fa6ec1",
      "text": "试着看一看\n各种各样的幽灵吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad457138d098942e08bb1dc9fda28a69a20091ae98431128aed2682daaf36612",
      "text": "我觉得安静的幽灵\n也很可怕哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11c75aa0e3017f57d6152d2b86aa845cfeae0168581ba03ef2a14afe3c6bc9fb",
      "text": "原来如此……确实，吓人并不只有\n突然吓一跳这一种方式呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc0e3e53ea3dac2f3b2195606caffd55dff180195ee6261b205199b5097e66f",
      "text": "为了能展现出适合自己的氛围，\n我再多思考一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_b:2_4_007_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3832dca52d287d8dbb8a9f5963f993ec22fff66d04a47738f2a502232406b61d",
      "text": "谢谢你听我商量。\n要是有不懂的地方，我再来找你商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
